(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Structures \(struct\) in C, detailing syntax declaration, member access operators \(. vs ->\), and nested structures.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Structures \(struct\) in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition and Conceptual Purpose:) Tj
T*
(   - A structure is a user-defined composite data type that packages together heterogeneous) Tj
T*
(   variables under a unified identifier.) Tj
T*
(   - Unlike arrays \(which enforce identical types\), structures group distinct data types \(e.g.) Tj
T*
(   char arrays, integers, floats, pointers\) into a cohesive domain model.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Syntax Anatomy:) Tj
T*
(   struct TagName {) Tj
T*
(   member_type1 member1;) Tj
T*
(   member_type2 member2;) Tj
T*
(   };) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Member Access Operators \(. vs ->\):) Tj
T*
(   - Direct Member Operator \(Dot .\): Used when accessing members through an actual structure) Tj
T*
(   variable:) Tj
T*
(   struct Gene g1;) Tj
T*
(   g1.length = 1200;) Tj
T*
(   - Indirect Member Operator \(Arrow ->\): Used when accessing members through a pointer to a) Tj
T*
(   structure:) Tj
T*
(   struct Gene *ptr = &g1;) Tj
T*
(   ptr->length = 1200; /* Syntactic sugar for: \(*ptr\).length = 1200 */) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Nested Structures:) Tj
T*
(   Structures can embed other structure instances to represent hierarchical relationships:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Complete ANSI C Demonstration Program:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(   #include <string.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   struct GenomicCoordinates {) Tj
T*
(   int chromosome;) Tj
T*
(   long start_position;) Tj
T*
(   long end_position;) Tj
T*
(   };) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   struct GeneAnnotation {) Tj
T*
(   char gene_id[16];) Tj
T*
(   char symbol[16];) Tj
T*
(   struct GenomicCoordinates locus; /* Nested structure */) Tj
T*
(   double expression_level;) Tj
T*
(   };) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   struct GeneAnnotation gene;) Tj
T*
(   strcpy\(gene.gene_id, "ENSG00000139618"\);) Tj
T*
(   strcpy\(gene.symbol, "BRCA2"\);) Tj
T*
(   gene.locus.chromosome = 13;) Tj
T*
