(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the C Preprocessor pipeline: #define macros, token-pasting \(##\), stringizing \(#\), and predefined macros.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The C Preprocessor: Advanced Directives and Operators:) Tj
T*
(   1. Operational Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   The C preprocessor runs prior to compilation, executing text transformations without) Tj
T*
(   understanding C syntax.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Parameterized Macros and Precedence Traps:) Tj
T*
(   #define SQUARE\(x\) \(\(x\) * \(x\)\)) Tj
T*
(   Must enclose all parameters and the entire replacement expression in parentheses to prevent) Tj
T*
(   operator precedence bugs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. The Stringizing Operator \(#\):) Tj
T*
(   Transforms a macro argument into a quoted string literal:) Tj
T*
(   #define DEBUG_PRINT\(var\) printf\(#var " = %d \(File: %s, Line: %d\)\\n", var, __FILE__, __LINE__\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. The Token-Pasting Operator \(##\):) Tj
T*
(   Merges two separate lexical tokens into a single combined token:) Tj
T*
(   #define MAKE_SAMPLE\(id\) int sample_##id = id * 10) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Standard Predefined Macros:) Tj
T*
(   - __FILE__: Current source file path \(string literal\).) Tj
T*
(   - __LINE__: Current source line number \(integer\).) Tj
T*
(   - __DATE__: Compilation date \("Mmm dd yyyy"\).) Tj
T*
(   - __TIME__: Compilation time \("hh:mm:ss"\).) Tj
T*
(   - __STDC__: Expands to 1 if compiler complies with ISO C standard.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   6. Demonstrative ANSI C Program:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   #define STRINGIZE\(x\) #x) Tj
T*
(   #define CONCAT_VARS\(a, b\) a ## b) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   int CONCAT_VARS\(patient_, 101\) = 98; /* Declares patient_101 */) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   printf\("Variable name: %s\\n", STRINGIZE\(patient_101\)\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Variable value: %d\\n", patient_101\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Compiled on: %s at %s in %s \(Line: %d\)\\n",) Tj
T*
(   __DATE__, __TIME__, __FILE__, __LINE__\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return 0;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
