(   2. The 12 Standard File Open Modes \(fopen\):) Tj
T*
(   Mode Read/Write? File Exists? File Missing? Initial Position) Tj
T*
(   "r" Read-Only Opens file FAILS \(NULL\) Beginning) Tj
T*
(   "w" Write-Only TRUNCATES to 0 CREATES new Beginning) Tj
T*
(   "a" Append-Only Preserves content CREATES new End of File) Tj
T*
(   "r+" Read/Write Preserves content FAILS \(NULL\) Beginning) Tj
T*
(   "w+" Read/Write TRUNCATES to 0 CREATES new Beginning) Tj
T*
(   "a+" Read/Append Preserves content CREATES new End for writing) Tj
T*
(   Appending "b" \(e.g. "rb", "wb+"\) disables CRLF/LF line-ending translations, mandatory for) Tj
T*
(   binary files!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Stream Buffer Flushing \(fflush\):) Tj
T*
(   Standard C file output is buffered in user-space RAM for efficiency.) Tj
T*
(   fflush\(fp\) forces all buffered data to be written immediately to disk.) Tj
T*
() Tj
