(   [Problem Statement]: Explain structure assignment semantics in C, detailing bitwise member copy and pointers aliasing.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Structure Assignment Semantics in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. Structure Assignment '=':) Tj
T*
(   In ANSI C, one structure variable can be assigned directly to another of the exact same type:) Tj
T*
(   struct Point p1 = {10, 20};) Tj
T*
(   struct Point p2 = p1; /* Legal! Performs shallow member-by-member copy */) Tj
