(   [Problem Statement]: Write an ANSI C program to create a binary indexed database of genomic gene records with constant-time random lookups by ID.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Indexed Genomic Database with Constant-Time Random Access:) Tj
T*
(   1. Architectural Design:) Tj
T*
(   In binary record files where each record has a fixed byte footprint sizeof\(GeneRecord\), record) Tj
T*
(   N resides at exact byte offset:) Tj
T*
(   Offset = \(N - 1\) * sizeof\(GeneRecord\).) Tj
T*
(   Enables O\(1\) instantaneous random lookups via fseek without scanning the file!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
